Tools that interact with the local system:

Copy

```
{
  name: "execute_command",
  title: "Execute Command",
  description: "Run a shell command",
  inputSchema: {
    type: "object",
    properties: {
      command: { type: "string" },
      args: { type: "array", items: { type: "string" } }
    }
  }
}
```

